{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ῥηγ-μίν or ῥηγ-μίς (neither form is found, unless [ῥηγμὶ]ν is to be restd. in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IGRom. 4.272.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(Elaea, cf. Wiener Sitzb."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "214(4).26", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ")), gen.ῖνος, ἡ, sea breaking on the beach, surf (v."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ῥήγνυμι B. 1", "author_abbreviation": "B.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄκρον ἐπὶ ῥηγμῖνος ἁλὸς . . θέεσκον Il. 20.229", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κώπῃσιν ἁλὸς ῥηγμῖνα βαθεῖαν τύπτετε, of the broken sea between Scylla and Charybdis,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 12.214", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; with the Prep. ἐπί, it may be rendered at the sea's edge,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκ . . βαῖνον ἐπὶ ῥηγμῖνι θαλάσσης Il. 1.437", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.150", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κοιμήθημεν ἐπὶ ῥηγμῖνι θαλάσσης ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "169", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. N. 5.13", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄκραις ἐπὶ ῥηγμῖσιν ἀξένου πόρου E. IT 253", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "013", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "λαοὶ δὲ παρὰ ῥ. θαλάσσης δίσκοισιν τέρποντο Il. 2.773", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 4.449", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὅταν κυμαίνουσα ἐκβάλλῃ [ἡ θάλαττα], . . παχεῖαι καὶ σκολιαὶ γίνονται αἱ ῥ.· ὅταν δὲ γαλήνη ᾖ, . . λεπταί εἰσι καὶ εὐθεῖαι Arist. Mete. 367b14", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "026", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". metaph., ῥ. βίοιο verge of life, i.e. death,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Emp. 20.5", "author_abbreviation": "Emp.", "tlg_author": "1342", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὥσπερ ῥηγμῖνα οὖσαν ἀέρος τὴν νεφέλην Arist. Mete. 367b19", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "026", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". τὰ ἀπορπύματα (fort. ἀπορρήγματα) τῆς πέτρας,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hsch.", "author_abbreviation": "Hsch.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}]}